> Quality patterns — common shapes; pick by task and compose freely: (12 October 2026, 02:49:45 +0200)
> - Adversarial verify: spawn N independent skeptics per finding, each prompted to REFUTE. Kill if ≥majority refute. Prevents plausible-but-wrong findings from surviving. (12 October 2026, 02:49:45 +0200)
>     const votes = await parallel(Array.from({length: 3}, () => () => (12 October 2026, 02:49:45 +0200)
>       agent(`Try to refute: ${claim}. Default to refuted=true if uncertain.`, {schema: VERDICT}))) (12 October 2026, 02:49:45 +0200)
>     const survives = votes.filter(Boolean).filter(v => !v.refuted).length >= 2 (12 October 2026, 02:49:45 +0200)
